Pornography is a product made by adults for the consumption by adults,{{sfn|Klein|2016}} the consumption of which has become more common among people due to the expansive use of the [[Internet]].{{sfn|Zattoni|Gül|Soligo|Morlacco|2021}} About 90% of pornography is consumed on the Internet with consumers preferring content that is in tune with their [[sexuality]].{{sfn|UdeM|2009}}{{sfn|Anthony|2012}} Pornography has been found to be a significant influencer of people's ideas about sex in the [[digital age]].{{sfn|Ashton|McDonald|Kirkman|2020}} Pornographic websites rank among the [[List of most-visited websites|top 50 most-visited websites]] worldwide.{{sfn|Bőthe|Tóth-Király|Zsila|Griffiths|2018}} [[XVideos]] and [[Pornhub]] are the two most-visited pornographic websites worldwide.{{sfn|Fritz|Malic|Fu|Paul|2022}}

Pornography consumption in people is found to induce "psychological moods and emotions" similar to those evoked during actual [[sexual intercourse]] and [[casual sex]].{{sfn|Burtăverde|Jonason|Giosan|Ene|2021}} Researchers identified four broad motivating factors for pornography consumption: an innate sexual drive or desire, to learn about sex and improve ones own sexual performance, peer pressure or social groups, lack of sexual relationship or absence of partner.{{sfn|Burtăverde|Jonason|Giosan|Ene|2021}} The majority of pornography consumers tend to be male, unmarried, with higher levels of education.{{sfn|Döring|2009}} Younger people are more frequent consumers of porn than older people. There has been a gradual increase in the consumption rates across different age groups with the increased availability of free porn over the Internet.{{sfn|Weitzer|2023|p=7}}

Researchers at [[McGill University]] ascertained that on viewing pornographic content, men reached their maximum [[Sexual arousal|arousal]] in about 11 minutes and women in about 12 minutes.{{Sfn|Blue|2009}} An average visit to a pornographic website lasts for 11.6 minutes.{{Sfn|Edelman|2009|p=212}} Both marriage and divorce are found to be associated with lower subscription rates for adult entertainment websites.{{Sfn|Edelman|2009|p=217}} Subscriptions are more widespread in regions that have higher measures of [[social capital]].{{Sfn|Edelman|2009|p=218}} Pornographic websites are most often visited during office hours.{{sfn|Montopoli|2010}} As per a recent CNBC report, seventy per cent of online-porn access in the US happens between nine-to-five hours.{{sfn|Forrester|2016}}

Sexual arousal and sexual enhancement tend to be the primary motivations among the self-reported reasons by users for their pornography consumption.{{sfn|Zattoni|Gül|Soligo|Morlacco|2021}}
Studies had found that greater levels of psychological distress leads to higher rates of pornography consumption.{{sfn|Zattoni|Gül|Soligo|Morlacco|2021}} Pornography may provide a temporary relief from [[Psychological stress|stress]], or [[anxiety]]. A need to assuage [[coping]] and [[boredom]] is also found to result in higher consumption of pornography.{{sfn|Zattoni|Gül|Soligo|Morlacco|2021}}

